   Aghabozorgi, Koorosh; van der Jagt, Alexander; Smith, Harry, Heriot Watt Univ, Inst Pl Environm \& Soc, Sch Energy Geosci Infrastruct \& Soc, Edinburgh, Scotland.
   Bell, Simon, Univ Edinburgh, Edinburgh Sch Architecture \& Landscape Architectur, Edinburgh, Scotland.
   Bell, Simon, Estonian Univ Life Sci, Chair Landscape Architecture, Kreutzwaldi 56-1, EE-51009 Tartu, Estonia.},
DOI = {10.1016/j.ufug.2025.128863},
