Abstract = {This is a communication about the research that enabled the creation of
   a methodological roadmap for the implementation of Municipal
   Environmental Zoning in Brazilian municipalities. It covers everything
   from the foundation to the pilot projects carried out based on technical
   criteria. The method used was based on primary data from public
   archives. The evaluation of the created script demonstrated the need for
   adjustments in order to meet the specific needs of the municipalities.
   Is this sense, a new script is being prepared, to meet the specificities
   of the country's coastal cities, whose theme is the object of a doctoral
   thesis.},
